  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment of the mango value chain in Moundou region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project &quot;Route de la Mangue&quot; focuses on an assessment of the mango value chain in the Moundou region, conducted by experts involved in development of the mango sector in Burkina Faso and the sub-region.Objective is to describe the key steps in the value chain, identify key stakeholders, advise on improvements in the value chain in the short term &#x2013; next mango season &#x2013; and advise on opportunities to professionalise the mango value chain in the Moundou region in the long(er) term (approximately a three to five years&apos; time-span).Based on the assessment, a follow-up project to further develop the mango value chain in the Moundou region is elaborated.</narrative>
  </description>
